    "relationships": {},
    "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}",
    "metadata_separator": "\n",
    "text": "登录会话有效期规则\n到期边界\n- 项目约定：当前时刻恰好等于到期时刻时，会话必须判定为无效。\n- 也就是说，`now == expires_at` 属于已过期。\n- 实现上有效条件写作 `now < expires_at`，不要写成 `now <= expires_at`。",
    "mimetype": "text/plain",
    "start_char_idx": null,
    "end_char_idx": null,
    "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}",
    "class_name": "TextNode"
  },
